{"seq":1,"slug":"unification-resolution","title":"合一与归结原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/unification-resolution","wordCount":1802,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"合一与归结原理\">合一与归结原理</h1><p>Prolog 的执行模型建立在两个数理逻辑机制之上：<strong>合一</strong>（Unification）将两个项通过变量替换变为相同，<strong>归结</strong>（Resolution）将逻辑蕴含转化为反证法驱动的自动推导。理解这两个机制，就掌握了 Prolog 运行时「怎样找到答案」的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本节围绕三个层层递进的概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>项</strong>（Term）：统一的数据表示形式，常量、变量与复合项既是程序也是数据，这是 Prolog 元编程能力的根源；</li>\n<li><strong>合一</strong>（Unification）：求两个项的最一般合一子（MGU），是对称、双向的匹配过程，可在任意方向传递绑定信息；</li>\n<li><strong>归结</strong>（Resolution）：在合一之上把「证明目标」改写为反证法搜索，SLD 归结的推导规则就是 Prolog 的执行语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>在 Prolog 中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>项</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>常量/变量/复合结构</td>\n<td>程序与数据的统一表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合一</td>\n<td>两个项</td>\n<td>MGU 替换或失败</td>\n<td>参数匹配、结构解构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归结</td>\n<td>目标 + 子句集</td>\n<td>成功推导（空子句）或失败</td>\n<td>查询求解的搜索过程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"项的结构与分类\">项的结构与分类</h2><p>Prolog 的数据世界由<strong>项</strong>（Term）构成，所有数据和程序都是项。项分为三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常量（Atom/Number）</td>\n<td>不可再分解的基本值</td>\n<td><code>alice</code>, <code>42</code>, <code>3.14</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量（Variable）</td>\n<td>以大写字母或下划线开头的占位符</td>\n<td><code>X</code>, <code>_Result</code>, <code>_</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合项（Compound）</td>\n<td>函子 + 参数列表</td>\n<td><code>parent(tom, bob)</code>, <code>f(X, g(Y))</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>复合项的递归定义使 Prolog 天然支持树形数据结构。列表 <code>[a, b, c]</code> 实际上是 <code>&#39;.&#39;(a, &#39;.&#39;(b, &#39;.&#39;(c, [])))</code> 的语法糖——一棵右递归的二叉树。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 项的结构示例&#10;term_example :-&#10;    X = f(a, g(Y, h(Z))),   % X 绑定到一个嵌套复合项&#10;    Y = b,                    % Y 被合一为常量 b&#10;    Z = c.                    % 最终 X = f(a, g(b, h(c)))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 项的结构示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>term_example :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    X = f(a, g(Y, h(Z))),   % X 绑定到一个嵌套复合项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y = b,                    % Y 被合一为常量 b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Z = c.                    % 最终 X = f(a, g(b, h(c)))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"合一算法\">合一算法</h2><p>合一是找到一个<strong>最一般合一子</strong>（Most General Unifier, MGU），使得两个项在该替换下变为同一个项。算法的核心思想是递归地分解两个项，逐步约束变量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"robinson-合一算法的步骤\">Robinson 合一算法的步骤</h3><p>给定两个项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，合一过程如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（同一常量或同一变量），成功，MGU 为空替换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是变量且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\notin vars(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，返回替换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{s/t\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是变量且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\notin vars(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，返回替换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{t/s\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = f(s_1,...,s_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = f(t_1,...,t_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（同函子同元数），递归合一各参数</li>\n<li>否则失败</li>\n</ol>\n<p>步骤 2、3 中的条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\notin vars(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 称为<strong>发生检查</strong>（Occurs Check），防止构造无限项。例如 <code>X = f(X)</code> 在严格合一下应失败，因为 X 出现在 f(X) 中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 合一成功的例子&#10;?- f(X, b) = f(a, Y).&#10;%  MGU: {X/a, Y/b}&#10;%  结果: f(a, b) = f(a, b)&#10;&#10;%% 合一失败的例子&#10;?- f(a, b) = g(a, b).  % 函子不同，失败&#10;?- f(a) = f(a, b).      % 元数不同，失败\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 合一成功的例子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- f(X, b) = f(a, Y).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%  MGU: {X/a, Y/b}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%  结果: f(a, b) = f(a, b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 合一失败的例子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- f(a, b) = g(a, b).  % 函子不同，失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- f(a) = f(a, b).      % 元数不同，失败</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"发生检查的实践权衡\">发生检查的实践权衡</h3><p>标准 Prolog 为了效率<strong>默认跳过发生检查</strong>——WAM（Warren Abstract Machine）的合一指令不执行此检查。这意味着 <code>X = f(X)</code> 在 SWI-Prolog 中会成功并构造一个循环项（有理树）。ISO Prolog 提供 <code>unify_with_occurs_check/2</code> 用于需要严格语义的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"?- unify_with_occurs_check(X, f(X)).&#10;false.  % 严格合一正确拒绝&#10;&#10;?- X = f(X).&#10;X = f(f(f(f(f(f(f(f(f(f(...)))))))))).  % 默认构造循环项\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>?- unify_with_occurs_check(X, f(X)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>false.  % 严格合一正确拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X = f(X).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = f(f(f(f(f(f(f(f(f(f(...)))))))))).  % 默认构造循环项</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认合一（=/2）</td>\n<td>跳过发生检查，允许循环项</td>\n<td>绝大多数程序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>严格合一</td>\n<td>执行发生检查，拒绝自引用</td>\n<td>定理证明、形式验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有理树合一</td>\n<td>显式支持循环结构</td>\n<td>无限数据流、协递归</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sld-归结-从逻辑到执行\">SLD 归结：从逻辑到执行</h2><p>Prolog 采用 <strong>SLD 归结</strong>（Selective Linear Definite clause resolution）作为推理策略。给定一组 Horn 子句（头部为单个正文字的子句）和一个否定的目标子句，SLD 归结通过反复<strong>消解</strong>目标中的文字来寻找矛盾——如果找到空子句，则原目标在程序的逻辑蕴含下为真。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>H</mi><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>←</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\leftarrow A_1, ..., A_i, ..., A_n \\quad\\quad H \\leftarrow B_1, ..., B_m \\quad\\quad \\theta = mgu(A_i, H)}{\\leftarrow (A_1, ..., A_{i-1}, B_1, ..., B_m, A_{i+1}, ..., A_n)\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span><