lass=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>上式表达了一步 SLD 归结：选择目标子句中的某个文字 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，找到一个程序子句使其头部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 能与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 合一，然后用子句体替换被选文字，并对整个目标施加合一替换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;?- ancestor(tom, jim)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;合一 ancestor(X,Y) :- parent(X,Y)&quot;| B[&quot;?- parent(tom, jim)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;合一 ancestor(X,Y) :- parent(X,Z), ancestor(Z,Y)&quot;| C[&quot;?- parent(tom, Z), ancestor(Z, jim)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;事实 parent(tom, jim)&quot;| D[&quot;□ 空子句 - 成功&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;事实 parent(tom, bob)&quot;| E[&quot;?- ancestor(bob, jim)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;合一 ancestor(X,Y) :- parent(X,Y)&quot;| F[&quot;?- parent(bob, jim)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;事实 parent(bob, jim)&quot;| G[&quot;□ 空子句 - 成功&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"?- ancestor(tom, jim)\"] --&gt;|\"合一 ancestor(X,Y) :- parent(X,Y)\"| B[\"?- parent(tom, jim)\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"合一 ancestor(X,Y) :- parent(X,Z), ancestor(Z,Y)\"| C[\"?- parent(tom, Z), ancestor(Z, jim)\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"事实 parent(tom, jim)\"| D[\"□ 空子句 - 成功\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"事实 parent(tom, bob)\"| E[\"?- ancestor(bob, jim)\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"合一 ancestor(X,Y) :- parent(X,Y)\"| F[\"?- parent(bob, jim)\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"事实 parent(bob, jim)\"| G[\"□ 空子句 - 成功\"]</pre><h2 id=\"sld-归结的完备性与局限\">SLD 归结的完备性与局限</h2><p>SLD 归结对 Horn 子句程序是<strong>归结完备</strong>的：如果一个原子是程序的逻辑后承，必然存在一条成功的 SLD 推导。但 Prolog 的深度优先搜索策略并不保证<strong>找到</strong>这条推导——如果左侧分支无限展开，右侧的成功分支永远不会被探索。</p>\n<p>这个局限引出了<a href=\"search-strategies-cut\">搜索策略与剪枝</a>中讨论的控制机制。完备性保证了解的存在性，但实际的可达性取决于搜索顺序和程序员对子句排列的控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合一在实践中的角色\">合一在实践中的角色</h2><p>合一不仅是模式匹配——它是<strong>双向</strong>的。函数式语言的模式匹配只能从实参绑定到形参，而合一可以在任意方向传递信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 双向性示例：append/3 的四种用法&#10;append([], L, L).&#10;append([H|T], L, [H|R]) :- append(T, L, R).&#10;&#10;?- append([1,2], [3,4], X).     % 拼接：X = [1,2,3,4]&#10;?- append(X, [3,4], [1,2,3,4]). % 分割：X = [1,2]&#10;?- append([1,2], X, [1,2,3,4]). % 求差：X = [3,4]&#10;?- append(X, Y, [1,2,3]).       % 所有分割方式（多解）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 双向性示例：append/3 的四种用法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>append([], L, L).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>append([H|T], L, [H|R]) :- append(T, L, R).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append([1,2], [3,4], X).     % 拼接：X = [1,2,3,4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append(X, [3,4], [1,2,3,4]). % 分割：X = [1,2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append([1,2], X, [1,2,3,4]). % 求差：X = [3,4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append(X, Y, [1,2,3]).       % 所有分割方式（多解）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种双向性源于合一的对称定义——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">unify(s, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">unify(t, s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 产生相同的 MGU。它使得一个谓词定义可以同时充当多种「函数」，极大提升了代码的复用性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wam-中的合一实现\">WAM 中的合一实现</h2><p>Warren Abstract Machine 是几乎所有现代 Prolog 编译器的基础架构。WAM 将合一分解为两组指令：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令类别</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>典型指令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GET 指令</td>\n<td>匹配头部参数</td>\n<td><code>get_structure f/n, Xi</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UNIFY 指令</td>\n<td>处理结构体内部参数</td>\n<td><code>unify_variable Xi</code>, <code>unify_value Xi</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PUT 指令</td>\n<td>构造目标参数</td>\n<td><code>put_structure f/n, Xi</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>WAM 在两种模式间切换：<strong>读模式</strong>（READ）在已有结构上遍历并匹配；<strong>写模式</strong>（WRITE）在堆上构造新结构。这种区分避免了对每个子项都进行完整的递归合一判断，极大提升了性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 编译 p(f(X), h(Y, f(a))) :- q(X, Y). 的头部合一&#10;%% 生成的 WAM 伪指令：&#10;%%   get_structure f/1, A1    -- 检查第一个参数是否为 f/1&#10;%%   unify_variable X4        -- X4 绑定 f 的参数（即 X）&#10;%%   get_structure h/2, A2    -- 检查第二个参数是否为 h/2&#10;%%   unify_variable X5        -- X5 绑定 h 的第一个参数（即 Y）&#10;%%   unify_variable X6        -- X6 绑定 h 的第二个参数&#10;%%   get_structure f/1, X6    -- 检查 X6 是否为 f/1&#10;%%   unify_constant a         -- 匹配常量 a\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 编译 p(f(X), h(Y, f(a))) :- q(X, Y). 的头部合一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 生成的 WAM 伪指令：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%%   get_structure f/1, A1    -- 检查第一个参数是否为 f/1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%%   unify_variable X4        -- X4 绑定 f 的参数（即 X）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%%   get_structure h/2, A2    -- 检查第二个参数是否为 h/2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%%   unify_variable X5        -- X5 绑定 h 的第一个参数（即 Y）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%%   unify_variable X6        -- X6 绑定 h 的第二个参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%%   get_structure f/1, X6    -- 检查 X6 是否为 f/1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%%   unify_constant a         -- 匹配常量 a</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"合一复杂度与优化\">合一复杂度与优化</h2><p>Robinson 的原始算法在最坏情况下是指数级的（因为替换的传递性可能导致指数级膨胀）。Martelli-Montanari 算法和 Paterson-Wegman 算法将合一优化到近线性时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot \\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是反阿克曼函数。实际的 Prolog 系统通过跳过发生检查和利用 WAM 的结构共享进一步将常见情况优化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Robinson（原始）</td>\n<td>最坏指数级</td>\n<td>语义清晰，实现简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Martelli-Montanari</td>\n<td>近线性</td>\n<td>并查集式替换合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Paterson-Wegman</td>\n<td>近线性</td>\n<td>更优的工程常数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合一的时间复杂度直接影响<a href=\"facts-rules-queries\">事实、规则与查询</a>中讨论的子句索引效率——索引机制本质上是在执行合一之前通过参数的顶层函子快速排除不可能匹配的子句。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>合一是 Prolog 语义的基石，本文的要点可以归纳为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>项分为常量、变量、复合项三类，列表是复合项的语法糖；</li>\n<li>合一求最一般合一子（MGU），其对称性带来自 <code>append/3</code> 那样的双向多用途谓词；</li>\n<li>发生检查防止构造无限项，但标准实现为效率默认跳过，需要严格语义时应显式使用 <code>unify_with_occurs_check/2</code>；</li>\n<li>SLD 归结把逻辑蕴含转化为反证法搜索，对 Horn 子句是归结完备的，但深度优先策略不保证实际可达；</li>\n<li>WAM 用 GET/UNIFY/PUT 指令把合一编译为高效的模式匹配过程。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这些机制后，可以进一步阅读<a href=\"facts-rules-queries\">事实、规则与查询</a>了解知识库的组织方式，以及<a href=\"search-strategies-cut\">搜索策略与剪枝</a>了解当搜索结果不理想时如何主动控制搜索顺序。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合一与归结原理","id":"合一与归结原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"项的结构与分类","id":"项的结构与分类"},{"level":2,"text":"合一算法","id":"合一算法"},{"level":3,"text":"Robinson 合一算法的步骤","id":"robinson-合一算法的步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"发生检查的实践权衡","id":"发生检查的实践权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"SLD 归结：从逻辑到执行","id":"sld-归结-从逻辑到执行"},{"level":2,"text":"SLD 归结的完备性与局限","id":"sld-归结的完备性与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"合一在实践中的角色","id":"合一在实践中的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"WAM 中的合一实现","id":"wam-中的合一实现"},{"level":2,"text":"合一复杂度与优化","id":"合一复杂度与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"事实、规则与查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/facts-rules-queries"}}